step("Verify: truncation still bounds what gets RECORDED")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val msg = _pad("error: e (", 150) + "): SMF emission failed: no code"
expect(_truncate(msg).length()).to_equal(_CUT)
```

